    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "The '80s called. They want their vibe back. <br>Inspired by early arcade racers, <i>Outrace</i> brings the pseudo-3D genre back to life with a vibrant colour palette and synthwave soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958890/extras/e1824f53f4ca2c65a9f888f6723b0d78.webp?t=1664292961\" /></div><br>Explore a world of branching racetracks, balmy beachside highways and neon sunsets.<br>Play arcade mode to relive the classic <i>Outrun</i> excitement of racing against the clock, <br>or turn off the timer and enjoy a retro drive at your own pace.<br>Unlock the fastest vehicles and most exotic track locations by performing well on the racetrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958890/extras/f3d0df9f4fe74fbc997e645bf78d530e.webp?t=1664292961\" /></div><br>Earn achievements for completing stages and setting record times.<br>Compete against the best Outrunners with top scores posted on global leaderboards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958890/extras/a2bbef962a103657ed698d0aca67319d.webp?t=1664292961\" /></div><br>Enjoy an authentic pseudo-3D racing game which brings the '80s arcade atmosphere to your fingertips.<br>Choose from a range of color filters to fine-tune your retro experience, including a truly old-school CRT effect.<br><i>Outrace</i> is more than a game. It's a whole atmosphere.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Racers, start your engines!",
    "about_the_game": "The '80s called. They want their vibe back. <br>Inspired by early arcade racers, <i>Outrace</i> brings the pseudo-3D genre back to life with a vibrant colour palette and synthwave soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958890/extras/e1824f53f4ca2c65a9f888f6723b0d78.webp?t=1664292961\" /></div><br>Explore a world of branching racetracks, balmy beachside highways and neon sunsets.<br>Play arcade mode to relive the classic <i>Outrun</i> excitement of racing against the clock, <br>or turn off the timer and enjoy a retro drive at your own pace.<br>Unlock the fastest vehicles and most exotic track locations by performing well on the racetrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958890/extras/f3d0df9f4fe74fbc997e645bf78d530e.webp?t=1664292961\" /></div><br>Earn achievements for completing stages and setting record times.<br>Compete against the best Outrunners with top scores posted on global leaderboards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958890/extras/a2bbef962a103657ed698d0aca67319d.webp?t=1664292961\" /></div><br>Enjoy an authentic pseudo-3D racing game which brings the '80s arcade atmosphere to your fingertips.<br>Choose from a range of color filters to fine-tune your retro experience, including a truly old-school CRT effect.<br><i>Outrace</i> is more than a game. It's a whole atmosphere.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Racers, start your engines!",
